        <mxCell id="c133" value="&lt;b&gt;Eliminated hand-offs.&lt;/b&gt; The As-Is chain of five re-keying steps collapses to a single write. Rejection now removes the uploaded file rather than leaving it on disk, and every approval, rejection, relocation and deletion is written to an append-only audit log. Administrative uploads publish directly because administrators are the moderating authority; contributor submissions always pass through 4.0." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
